{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53701","headline":"酬苏少尹中元夜追怀去年此夕鄙人与故李谏议郭员外见访感时伤旧之作 · 令狐楚","name":"酬苏少尹中元夜追怀去年此夕鄙人与故李谏议郭员外见访感时伤旧之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直继先朝卫与英，能移孝友作忠贞。\n剑门失险曾缚虎，淮水安流缘斩鲸。\n黄阁碧幢惟是俭，三公二伯未爲荣。\n惠连忽赠池塘句，又遣羸师破胆惊。\n（见蒲积中《古今岁时杂咏》卷二八）（按：《全唐诗》卷四七三收此爲李逢吉诗，题作《奉酬忠武李相公见寄》，疑误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}